    "summary": "Adds an actual PROJECT Disposable service with native background session orchestration, separate control/data/Saved lanes, heartbeat/resume/lease invalidation and bounded owned-resource drain. Four JUnit platform integration tests use real Unix sockets and daemon session authority, including two real Projects with same root, actual project closeAndDispose, pending-call cancellation and write uncertainty. APP gateway and PluginLifecycle remain unchanged.",
